# No Barrel Files

Do not create `index.ts` barrel files that re-export from other modules. Import directly from the specific file instead:

```typescript
// ❌ Bad: barrel file (types/index.ts)
export * from './user'
export * from './campaign'

// ❌ Bad: importing from barrel
import type { User, Campaign } from '../types'

// ✅ Good: import directly from specific files
import type { User } from '../types/user'
import type { Campaign } from '../types/campaign'
```

Benefits: clearer dependencies, better tree-shaking, easier to trace imports.
